OL,3,GNEWSAMovember maypole dancing for men's
OL,4,Ahealth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of men has raised money and
OL,7,Fawareness for Movember by learning
OL,8,Fdances to perform around the village
OL,9,Fmaypole.
OL,11,FTheir dance took place in Offenham,
OL,12,FWorcestershire, on Sunday to "get more
OL,13,Fmen talking about men's health",
OL,14,Forganisers said.
OL,16,FKelly Jordan, who had the idea for Mo
OL,17,FAround the Maypole in the summer, said
OL,18,Fwomen and children had usually danced
OL,19,Fwith ribbons around the 64ft (19.5m)
OL,20,Fpole which was at the centre of village
OL,21,Flife.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
