OL,3,GNEWSAMovember maypole dancing for men's
OL,4,Ahealth
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The maypole was simply the vehicle to
OL,7,Fstart those conversations," she said,
OL,8,Fadding the event saw an "incredible
OL,9,Fturnout" despite the rain, and so far
OL,10,Fhas raised more than #6,300.
